Third-party assets (NOT covered by the MIT license above):

The MIT license covers this project's source code. Third-party car models under
`public/models/` retain their individual Creative Commons licenses, including
CC BY 4.0, CC BY-NC 4.0 and CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. The project author does not relicense
those assets under MIT. Model-specific authors, sources, license links and
provenance notices are recorded in `src/data/carCredits.json`,
`docs/model-licenses.md`, embedded asset metadata and the site's Credits section.

Web adaptations include lossless compression, framing, lighting and optional
body recoloring; fixed racing liveries are retained. Applicable ShareAlike terms
remain attached to the adapted assets. Consult each model's recorded license and
notices before reuse; these licenses do not establish ownership of underlying
vehicle designs, trademarks or unverified upstream assets.
